    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST!</h1><p></p><br><h1>TRADING CARDS!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/62b7ca3ecaf6e9e8cac3d77c71e56907.avif?t=1749461491\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/f8f44e2463943f30a45a59237f82e2ca.poster.avif?t=1749461491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/f8f44e2463943f30a45a59237f82e2ca.webm?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/f8f44e2463943f30a45a59237f82e2ca.mp4?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SKIBIDI BACKROOMS</strong> is a co-op horror game for a group of 1-8 players. Solo mode is also available.<br><br><strong>STRANGER</strong> finds himself in an unknown anomaly and is transported to scary and atmospheric rooms - BACKROOMS. Scary and dangerous SKIBIDIST will be waiting for you here! I don't recommend dealing with them...<br><br>Come on! Call your friends so it won't be so scary in these terribly stressful rooms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/95085b996aa59f1960d4f3c745ceb139.poster.avif?t=1749461491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/95085b996aa59f1960d4f3c745ceb139.webm?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/95085b996aa59f1960d4f3c745ceb139.mp4?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect from the game?</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A minimal interface, realistic graphics and a terrifying atmosphere will provide an unreal immersion into the world of SKIBIDI BACKROOMS<br></li><li>Co-op will allow you and your friends to fully enjoy the atmosphere. Try to escape from SKIBIDIST!<br></li><li>BACKROOMS hides some kind of danger. Various liminal spaces will break your brain.<br></li><li>Regular updates - adding new locations and mechanics.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/f8f44e2463943f30a45a59237f82e2ca.poster.avif?t=1749461491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/f8f44e2463943f30a45a59237f82e2ca.webm?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/f8f44e2463943f30a45a59237f82e2ca.mp4?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SKIBIDI BACKROOMS</strong> is a co-op horror game for a group of 1-8 players. Solo mode is also available.<br><br><strong>STRANGER</strong> finds himself in an unknown anomaly and is transported to scary and atmospheric rooms - BACKROOMS. Scary and dangerous SKIBIDIST will be waiting for you here! I don't recommend dealing with them...<br><br>Come on! Call your friends so it won't be so scary in these terribly stressful rooms.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/95085b996aa59f1960d4f3c745ceb139.poster.avif?t=1749461491\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/95085b996aa59f1960d4f3c745ceb139.webm?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515210/extras/95085b996aa59f1960d4f3c745ceb139.mp4?t=1749461491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect from the game?</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A minimal interface, realistic graphics and a terrifying atmosphere will provide an unreal immersion into the world of SKIBIDI BACKROOMS<br></li><li>Co-op will allow you and your friends to fully enjoy the atmosphere. Try to escape from SKIBIDIST!<br></li><li>BACKROOMS hides some kind of danger. Various liminal spaces will break your brain.<br></li><li>Regular updates - adding new locations and mechanics.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "SKIBIDI BACKROOMS is a cooperative horror game for a group of 1-8 players. Solo mode is also available. You have to survive among the BACKROOMS and find a way out before you are overtaken by the SKIBIDIST. Updates and various interesting things await you...",
